{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204120","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1320412001:0":{"text":"후긴! 필요한 재료는 다 모아왔어요!","source_cn":"呼金！你需要的材料我们都找到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3B20A20A4C1168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320412002:0":{"text":"역시! 이런 얼음 천지에서도 아주 잽싸단 말이지!","source_cn":"嚯，真不愧是你们！到了这冰天雪地的地方，手脚还是一样麻利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185DAA3B68AFACE7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320412003:0":{"text":"좋아, 이제는 내 차례군!","source_cn":"行了，接下来就看我的吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB8EC8228A68CF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1320412004:0":{"text":"도구를 들고 한참을 두드린 후긴은 드디어 온도차 탐지기를 완성했다.","source_cn":"呼金拿起工具敲敲打打，好一阵之后，才终于做好了温差探测器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBD3BDF5E4D9F373","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320412005:1":{"text":"와! 이게 최종으로 완성된 탐지기인가요?","source_cn":"哇！这就是探测器的最终成品了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB460E3AF0A8098D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:7::3":{"text":"온도차 탐지기","source_cn":"温差探测器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78742052C485E5A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320412006:0":{"text":"맞아! \"히트 램프\"라고 부르면 돼. 일정 범위 내에서 온도차가 큰 곳을 찾아내는 녀석이지. 물론 지형의 영향은 받지 않아.","source_cn":"没错！你们可以叫他“热灯”。他能在一定范围内发现温差较...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37E2280AD6329C2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320412007:0":{"text":"...음, 히트 램프는 어떻게 쓰면 되나요?","source_cn":"……呃，那我要怎么使用热灯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0F8E1AA85BE0FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320412008:0":{"text":"아주 간단해. 들고 다니며 주변을 탐색하면 끝이야. 온도차를 인식하면 소리가 나고, 화면에 구체적인 방향이 표시될 거야.","source_cn":"很简单，带着他四处走走就行。只要识别到温差，他就会发出...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B6D3212066581E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320412009:0":{"text":"하지만 조심해서 쓰라고! 히트 램프의 정확도를 높이기 위해 고향에서 가져온 재료를 많이 썼거든. 만약 고장 나면 수리할 재료가 없어.","source_cn":"你们使用的时候千万得小心！为了提高热灯的精准度，我用了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD021E3F8F1A954EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320412010:0":{"text":"오, 알겠어요. 조심할게요. 고마워요!","source_cn":"嗯，我会小心的，多谢啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40784A8279A2A85C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320412011:0":{"text":"게르다 부인, 이제 어디서 온도차를 확인해 보려고요?","source_cn":"格尔达女士，接下来我们去哪里探测温差呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31AE7BB88662C485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320412012:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">여관 근처 강가</style>와 <style=\"highlight\">여관 뒷산</style>에 야외 온천이 있을 가능성이 있어요.","source_cn":"<style=highlight>靠近旅店的河边</s...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFCB2A07115016D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320412013:0":{"text":"먼저 강가를 확인해보죠! 여관으로 돌아가는 길에 마침 지나가는 곳이니까요.","source_cn":"先去河边看看吧！正好返回旅店的路上要经过那里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x443202928A69A521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格尔达":{"text":"게르다","source":"格尔达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"st